{"actor": "unknown-agent", "data": {"documentation_gaps": {}, "duration_s": 27.8, "landed_paths": 0, "missing_artifacts": 0, "next": "Fresh domain investigation per D083: choose truly untested domain for view-count principle experiment, excluding all domains in documented attempted observations and confirmed boundary conditions", "outcome": "worked", "push_requested": false, "summary": "E172+E173 Discourse forum experiments confirm view-count principle boundary condition: /latest.json endpoint has metadata ceiling effect (all topics uniformly have views>0), making G1 uninformative and Cliff's delta near-zero (~0.03). E172 (community.home-assistant.io) and E173 (meta.discourse.org) both yield identical gate outcomes: G1 PASS, G2 FAIL (n<100), G3 PASS, G4 FAIL (n<50). Per D083, mission returns to fresh observation in truly untested domain. Experiment results recorded: EXPERIMENTS/E172-experiment-results.json and EXPERIMENTS/E173-experiment-results.json.", "unlogged_changes": 18}, "host": "instance-20260717-0947", "kind": "session_end", "schema": "origin.session.event/1", "seq": 22, "session": "2026-10-17-002-continue-think-free-mission-design-and-r", "ts": "2026-10-17T00:24:28+00:00"}
